        "content": "## AI Lead Qualifier\nPoint your contact form at this webhook. A local LLM scores buying intent 1-10, summarizes the lead and drafts a first reply. Hot leads (7+) ping you on Discord instantly.\n\nSetup: Ollama + `ollama pull llama3.2`, paste your Discord webhook URL, activate.\n\nNeed it customized or built for your stack? Siren Labs builds custom AI automations: https://ko-fi.com/4siren123/commissions",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "3a5feadf-93db-4b7b-b1c6-2a1f784a2d85",
      "name": "About this workflow",
